==id OpenNDK mmu_lib.sfd 47.1
* mmu.library's calls (MMULib's interface, not part of NDK 3.2), for OpenNDK.
* Read from openmmu's own jump table and code in amigachrome-guest
* (libraries/openmmu); calls openmmu does not implement yet take APTR in
* address registers and ULONG in data registers.
* Copyright (c) 2026 AmigaChrome Team. MIT licence (see OpenNDK/LICENSE).
==base _MMUBase
==basetype struct Library *
==libname mmu.library
==bias 30
==public
==include <exec/types.h>
==include <exec/libraries.h>
==include <utility/tagitem.h>
==version 40
